  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e078240d909a09d1c583d520",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了设法让状况好转，\n她与成田大进与琵琶晨光两人\n一起跑了模拟赛，但时间仍没有缩短。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae1793af4fdcb36e9cd12d7614c4692d39a311bf0db219024df04684bb55b5c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db80894e8e49238b67559a5c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使如此胜利奖券还是说：\n“能跑出最棒的比赛太好了”。\n琵琶晨光问她：“输了不会不甘心吗”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06a2858d99253d17b51ef9e0eec2c99ebea748526ea285c33816d75439c9dba0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8112aa4c307f3a0e6f6d7ea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券不理解问题含意，\n虽感困惑，仍拿出干劲，\n积极地继续努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27572c6cd400fc8178dfe727d4841dcaa197e46886db8649d073928bb0306593",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bfce3387f62d259462c07fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“精彩比赛”",
      "source_fingerprint": "1486b0118241186a025992950dd7ef5fb1cbb24efac7454c2e10f9e073635470",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a89d2b838bb39971c12b329",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在休假期间，\n胜利奖券与训练员一起来观赏比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19126a7c00435c8434a106b219a20637c9cb9b8b60e077c3aab393393d4a5125",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e197d8a46faffded33967a52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看着将各自的心愿投注于赛事，\n拼命奔跑的赛马娘们，\n被这场比赛感动的她也发愤要努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60db287d4a16c6a3dffb044b62e2d00aa2ed17e67ebd0c9785e330bcb3e811db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd8f627e93ab95db20ab6f82",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过……现实却与她的决心背道而驰，\n胜利奖券的停滞期仍持续着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccaf8297afb6ce75c49c06dd24704f52ec4b8450ea5975dc90917f4e2b121ce7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6051732f66a75fdc6f51d11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "停滞期？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e300f29f022f8d0c9f02c28a8da3128520b3f2219e7ef17aea717ce4f324305",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f188210c52b614b3498b4dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券不断思考为何而跑，\n然后她发现\n自己已失去了“不想输的心”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8237300a36952534fe8d155e58e5072c7aa9bf8406842ac2a3f9cfd0c78f2e7c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e17fbad4971ac80951d4d517",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她想起了自己曾经的梦想，\n是在所有赛事中获胜，\n将“最棒的比赛”献给观众。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b1b1527b6ce04b814b141354d1e5dc3133ec89882ebf1fd32eed7c0dcf680c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9c5373f813108e45604678e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券感谢琵琶晨光与成田大进\n让她意识到这份重要的意念，\n并提出要跟她们跑一场模拟赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8065c40d3e4e63bd6dcbe483f4f375bcd89c4ec0ee51a9d22271974573d4806c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9321c34c6c8cc871c357931",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "借由这场胜负，\n两人亲身感受到，\n以前那个热血的胜利奖券回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c8c6d0c9471277f545275e54fb888a11f9d61ca59488ab4e0411bf3603eeeb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:065a52431edc04eeb058d9ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是再次成为“BNW”的三人，\n将在年底最棒的舞台──\n有马纪念狭路相逢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdb0bcec2a33e821fb08632e3699ac992ccce9f8ee58d8a13b402eb990d09e16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e319201e6c4110ed147067f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "BNW再次燃烧",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f8231a49df856bd25273912f14b2f02406e7bc9a66d70d670aee466ca211bb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed9741b442a290def6e26988",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入了“夏季集训”期间。\n跑完她的梦想“日本德比”后，\n胜利奖券也放松了下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c34290e538ae0299838c56bd53e4f0f816938d8ae26bbfd34a0682642ba6f03e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f7b3d7daecb03e5fb66b9c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与她就这样展开了夏季集训。",
      "source_fingerprint": "40d61315877938ff73269588df9b83caf394b7b3a57c7f330e0308514eba3a48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6de04a61852775e13c3bcd3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3f468be18b4710f6f6bcac9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“夏季集训”的季节到了。\n为了迎接“有马纪念”，\n胜利奖券干劲十足。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0af18307ecc7eca4e3cf6f6ea4e36c2481006685bcafa5ddcff91c74b0afc3ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0ec8e74b5c54dd2f22f262d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与她就这样展开了炙热的夏日！",
      "source_fingerprint": "454e521752be94b9f0b7fc8c432ee815dc28dc433422534184666e9c0ff77f16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7df0bae6363e4c528372db9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第三年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eef37080660583492caac78b957b8f144bbb2896156162385fc6034f5649e4df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035407.json",
      "json_path": [
