      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于来临的“日本德比”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82a29e5f97132b9682ad7905b74eada8839f341f0d3990100633615256449295",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3244d96e9bf4178745b056b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于自己能否如梦想中那样，\n在这场比赛中让粉丝们看到梦想，\n胜利奖券深感不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "903d9ca2022213097bd0491f2402f4c2c79ee763e89e345c4a23807266a9c8ee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cc735ce3976577ba4e52984",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但看到赛场的直播影像中，\n粉丝为她加油的样子后，\n胜利奖券的不安消失了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e2281e9413e492eca4fe6da9b88fc85824b0b6e29b7cd47837317ad47995eb8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:060663c56785ab003cc89caf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了回报他们的期待，\n她踏入了向往的大舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "524a6ab427d7ebfa1a972c291bb9e165f4f5220fc842a82b041d03805d6e23a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ba31c40775b6376350a0da3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向日本德比",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4074326c9093437fbf37c8e5b00d67df67963c2eed1109506df4b11f06953bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035412.json",
      "json_path": [
