    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34f12aed992fd754403db919",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“菊花赏”的开赛日到了。\n赛场观众认为“BNW”在“日本德比”后\n应有所成长，出现了热烈的期待声浪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b88161f5a626f84bf845c0537d04e21a27aadb15e80fa56a61235752d57df03",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1d192385c78c2726653467e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券发愤要跑出一场\n让观众能乐在其中的热血比赛，\n之后便踏上了赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d162968acf7b95ab3901a2f3bf32d2325a35f49ec185bc2341725a5fc06864b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f038e3c284efc13106448d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向菊花赏",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32fe703b345a297a6972e4f3115aec53ea8a9931382257ccb6b146928c5537e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a42a83e678c21a34adaacb8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“大阪杯”当天。\n观众们情绪高涨，\n期待着胜利奖券与成田大进的对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c57fcc11173a48aeeb9ee5ac3f1c0e1ae1e6a0a1e94010b08e0e492223dac59",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f17ad7d44170954e0c02bba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自己能好好地回应观众们的声援，\n与成田大进来一场热血的比赛吗？\n她对此感到十分在意及紧张。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ebd3a491da46042d27dbda91b043093096f9a9e0acd10b95a8e0a264a7fd511",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:779f5eed10a0855b51adb91b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使如此，\n为了与对手来一场最棒的比赛，\n胜利奖券仍拿出干劲踏入赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8998f437cf028b132a481f0629e5107d1a27de24ba99f617d134c7eb9cf21c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:715e71a83c06d9738db1e04e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向大阪杯",
      "source_fingerprint": "4423575424741415861c85b2043870db30adb78bc366fd97792335ee5949271c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035414.json",
      "json_path": [
