    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c448c420503c6d1e530662b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "来到“宝冢纪念”当天，\n胜利奖券对着训练员发愤表示\n一定会跑出一场精彩的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "735259a1faaf0f71ce25b60614f9d428afb2ba17a87aed59bae7902842ea4215",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da1fdff90a27f4e19e7bed77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而在竞赛前，胜利奖券对琵琶晨光说：\n“我们全力跑出\n令大家感动的‘最棒比赛’吧”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77b8967c711fbca47715028f4b7570fc712be9ee09ada589932a69c8647dbdf1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db62d88cedb670871722fae2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "琵琶晨光虽对这句话感到不太对劲，\n仍表示她将全力以赴。\n两人的胜负就要开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9086033dc617f473b57a49588e27dca9713be5384236122fd7378da2aea72752",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:783409a2152b60d6337802c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向宝冢纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "4743315d92bef0a1d3815aad5f8b1374f193f12e0416639bccc69a7a0dc88f06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7905b95641f5b4bc4dfa0ac6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“有马纪念”当天。\n赛场已涌入众多\n满心期盼“BNW”对决的观众。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b66c915166ab7b25815df49c10375a66c949ba1cfcd6c09bb73ac114885014",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8319ac83e8ac1fa057ce2e2d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券对成田大进与琵琶晨光宣告，\n自己将会拿出十足干劲，\n挑战这场比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2aa2acb352cc3475aa2cc6d807d0bd546e64a09f145480602a53802343069f26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29c5366193df4a5f2574dd5d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后……\n在撼动会场的欢呼声迎接下，\n她们一起跑向一决胜负的舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f4b05e8c9a3f0aec1b26c03f330f53e91ba37d03617b9e106e0837fb82f7f40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
