      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4b3c9f67e74134c738f0d43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利奖券在GⅠ赛事中\n留下了极佳的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae22b8aed92b3744e90d04c36bfd003147b74e49b3fdf874da7faeb7a69f29c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f74bc5758b170ddc013bd1bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "受到成田大进与琵琶晨光的慰劳后，\n胜利奖券对她们的炽热友情心怀感激。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ed85e1d2036f6baf3d49c0fbedb3e3ef2d785e27a7ce3b7adef1e316b4cbe97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d71896f8b900415130446206",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下个目标是“弥生赏”，\n胜利奖券将在那里\n与成田大进一较高下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10b586dffadc58d98cce2fde1ea9d8e3c02ab7d7c79c1b9b6051d5634bc858f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1035/storytimeline_501035418.json",
      "json_path": [
