      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于全力回应全力以赴之对手的胜利奖券，\n虽然没有说出口，\n却看得出成田大进已经认可她了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58a402442d7ffb3d51771cd060f00a94095931f3090e0037eaadd6257bbb32d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
